Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.53,0:00:04.30,Default,SOTA,0,0,0,,You... you look great... \Nin your swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.13,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.75,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,A teru teru bozu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.09,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:27.24,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,Is that Koharu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.50,Default,MADOKA,0,0,0,,What the heck is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.48,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C826&\bord0\b1\fad(482,140)}The {\c&H9657E9&}Cold Sato-san {\c&HC4C826&}is Only {\c&H9657E9&}Sweet {\c&HC4C826&}to {\c&H9657E9&}Me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.01,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs26\t(0,3000,\fs22)\shad0\bord9\c&H5E8C79&\frz336\frx14\fry0\move(464.667,47.667,452,80,0,2988)\3c&H90FFD5&}Sato-san! Are you okay?
