Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:37.85,Italics,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Next time, "Can't Help \NFalling in Love with You."
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.76,0:23:40.02,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(528,1)\fnVerdana\fs17\shad0\c&H7E572F&\3c&HC2B8FB&\blur4\pos(146.667,148)}Next Time
